{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Apple 新款配備 OLED 螢幕的 iPad mini 支援快速充電，但盒內附送的轉換器不足以觸發快充，用戶須另購 35W 或以上的 USB-C 電源轉換器。新機 Wi-Fi 型號售價 US$699 起，10 月 28 日（星期三）開放預訂，11 月 6 日（星期五）正式發售。</p>\n<h2>快充須另購 35W 轉換器</h2>\n<p>據 Apple 規格，配合可提供 35W 或以上功率的 USB-C 電源轉換器，裝置可在約 30 分鐘內充至 50% 電量。該轉換器須另行購買，售價 US$59；盒內隨附的則為 20W USB-C 電源轉換器。</p>\n<p>電池方面，新款 iPad mini 配備 18.9 瓦時電池，官方標示可支援長達 10 小時網頁瀏覽或影片播放。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"與 iPad mini 相關的圖片\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"789\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/ipadmini7.webp\" width=\"1232\"/></figure>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.apple.com/ipad-mini/specs/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">消息來源</a></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T15:01:24.493244+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":323,"images":1,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T14:47:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T00:38:11.619924+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T14:58:58.653517+00:00","content_hash":"0c13fcd27906ec118e56c85dc736954c3978b5c68f6a673ab59415cd8be86910","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T15:01:24.493244+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}